edit contacts:
I created many stored procedures for this to alter each aspect of a column individually. The only one which cant be edited is user attribution.

CREATE DEFINER=`root`@`localhost` PROCEDURE `AlterPhone`(
	IN NewPhoneNumber VARCHAR(50),
    IN SearchFirstName VARCHAR(50),
    IN SearchLastName VARCHAR(50),
    IN SearchUserAttribution VARCHAR(50)
)
BEGIN
	UPDATE Contacts 
    SET Phone = NewPhoneNumber
    WHERE FirstName = SearchFirstName AND LastName = SearchLastName AND UserAttribution = SearchUserAttribution;
END


